# Quality gate

- Every phase has multiple steps listed in `docs/phases/PHASE_N.md`.
- End of each step, in order: test → phase/step audit → retest → **100% only** (≤99% = fail, redo) → commit + push `main` → Jeremy-voice devlog in `docs/devlogs/`.
- Voice guide: `@docs/reference/authentic-voice-notes.md`
- Full protocol: `@docs/PHASE_STEP_PROTOCOL.md`
- End of phase: **FULL STOP.** Publish `docs/phases/PHASE_N_HUMAN_CHECKLIST.md`. Do not start the next phase until Jeremy clears the UI/UX checklist.
- Never stage `projects/`, `data/`, or secrets into the app repo.